Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Water changes state. Garmi se liquid paani vapour ban sakta hai aur thandak se vapour boondon mein badal sakta hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

